+ * PLL (MCLK 19.2 MHz): VT 19.2 MHz / 5 (0x0304) * 255 (0x0306) / 7
+ * (0x0300) = 139.89 MHz, four pixels per clock; OP 19.2 MHz / 3 (0x030e)
+ * * 85 (0x0310) = 544 Mbps per lane. Line length 7200 (0x0342), 2588
+ * lines (0x0340): 30.03 fps.
+ */
